      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E005",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Accordingly, the Supreme Court properly denied the defendant's motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint without regard to the sufficiency of the plaintiff's opposition papers",
